">       </ul>  </div><div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 0 ft</li>  <li>Swim 30 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +11 (2d6+9 plus grab)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 10 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>gnaw</li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 22</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 14</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 16</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 1</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 12</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 8</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+5</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +12 (+16 grapple)</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 24  (can't be tripped) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Improved Initiative</li>  <li>Lightning Reflexes</li>  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Stealth</li>  </ul></li>  <li>Weapon Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Bite</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Escape Artist +10</li>  <li>Perception +7</li>  <li>Stealth +8</li>  <li>Swim +14</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   warm oceans <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or nest (3-6)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Gnaw (Ex)</strong> If a giant moray begins a round with a grabbed foe, it inflicts automatic bite damage (2d6+9 points of damage). A giant moray eel possesses a second set of jaws in its throat that aid in swallowing-it can make a second bite attack (+11 attack, 1d6+3) against a foe it has already grabbed.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nThe moray eel is a ferocious predator, capable of holding prey in its primary jaws while a smaller set of jaws inside its throat chews away bite-sized portions.\n\nMoray Eel Animal Companion Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +5 natural armor; Speed swim 30 ft.; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 16, Con 12, Int 1, Wis 12, Cha 8; Special Qualities low-light vision, grab.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack bite (2d6); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities gnaw.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Giant Moray Eel (CR 5)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 5 \nXP 1,600 \nN Large animal (aquatic)\n\nInit +6; Senses low-light vision, scent; Perception +7   \nDefense   \nAC 19, touch 11, flat-footed 17 (+2 Dex, +8 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 52 (7d8+21)\n\nFort +8, Ref +9, Will +3   \nOffense   \nSpd swim 30 ft. \nMelee bite +11 (2d6+9 plus grab)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft. \nSpecial Attacks gnaw   \nStatistics   \nStr 22, Dex 14, Con 16, Int 1, Wis 12, Cha 8 \nBase Atk +5; CMB +12 (+16 grapple); CMD 24 (can't be tripped)\n\nFeats Improved Initiative, Lightning Reflexes, Skill Focus (Stealth), Weapon Focus (bite)\n\nSkills Escape Artist +10, Perception +7, Stealth +8, Swim +14; Racial Modifiers +8 Escape Artist   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  warm oceans \nOrganization solitary, pair, or nest (3-6)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nGnaw (Ex) If a giant moray begins a round with a grabbed foe, it inflicts automatic bite damage (2d6+9 points of damage). A giant moray eel possesses a second set of jaws in its throat that aid in swallowing-it can make a second bite attack (+11 attack, 1d6+3) against a foe it has already grabbed.   \nDescription\n\nThe moray eel is a ferocious predator, capable of holding prey in its primary jaws while a smaller set of jaws inside its throat chews away bite-sized portions.\n\nMoray Eel Animal Companion Starting Statistics: Size Medium; AC +5 natural armor; Speed swim 30 ft.; Attack bite (1d8); Ability Scores Str 14, Dex 16, Con 12, Int 1, Wis 12, Cha 8; Special Qualities low-light vision, grab.\n\n7th-Level Advancement: Size Large; AC +3 natural armor; Attack bite (2d6); Ability Scores Str +8, Dex -2, Con +4; Special Qualities gnaw.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":5},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":7},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"abi